    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "60a76422f0ca132c",
      "translationZh": "Transformer 中注意力机制的计算量随序列长度呈二次方增长。对于长度为 n n n 的序列，标准注意力需要 O(n2) O(n^2) O(n2) FLOPs 的计算量和 O(n2) O(n^2) O(n2) 的内存来计算和存储注意力分数矩阵。FlashAttention 等优化实现通过分块计算，且从不显式生成完整的注意力矩阵，将内存需求降至 O(n) O(n) O(n)，但计算量仍为 O(n2) O(n^2) O(n2)。对于超长序列（32k+ 个 token），即使使用 FlashAttention，训练仍会逼近单 GPU 显存的极限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0c887046032d7812",
      "translationZh": "以下场景中，长上下文训练至关重要：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d45e60668aa3ba99",
      "translationZh": "文档理解：处理整本书籍、法律文档或研究论文",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "483ed57ec1b6aeca",
      "translationZh": "代码分析：理解包含多个相互关联文件的大型代码库",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "63c114016f67a84e",
      "translationZh": "推理任务：逐步“思考”的模型可能在推理过程中生成数千个词元",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "77ef2f1434eb6518",
      "translationZh": "检索增强生成：将大量检索到的段落纳入上下文",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a1b875c5c965b19d",
      "translationZh": "传统的数据并行在这里无济于事——每个 GPU 仍然需要在注意力模块内处理完整的序列。我们需要一种方法，将序列本身拆分到多个设备上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "73f9b0e5d9df8f63",
      "translationZh": "Ulysses 的工作原理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ee10ea4e0d06d360",
      "translationZh": "DeepSpeed Ulysses 论文提出的 Ulysses 序列并行（SP）采用了一种巧妙的方法：除了沿序列维度进行拆分，它还将注意力头划分到不同的 GPU 上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6cab8a93cdd43280",
      "translationZh": "Ulysses 沿序列维度拆分输入序列，并使用全对全通信交换键值对，使每个 GPU 能够计算一部分注意力头。（来源：Snowflake Engineering Blog）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2fc3e378d1da30c3",
      "translationZh": "其工作方式如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
